@HomeStore.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5218
@BearerToken = REPLACE_WITH_JWT_TOKEN

GET {{HomeStore.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat - Send message
POST {{HomeStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"receiverId": 2,
	"content": "Xin chao, toi can ho tro"
}

###

### Chat - Get conversations list
GET {{HomeStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/chat/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat - Get messages in one conversation
GET {{HomeStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/chat/conversations/2/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat - Get unread messages
GET {{HomeStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/chat/messages/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat - Get admin user
GET {{HomeStore.API_HostAddress}}/api/chat/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
